{"id":"5720cafbff146a93","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization.md","title":"Envelope extremal property and existence","display":"thm-pbenvelopecharacterization — Envelope extremal property and existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization","aliases":["27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization"],"display":"thm-pbenvelopecharacterization — Envelope extremal property and existence","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbenvelopes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.2","source_statement":"Barycentric proof of the envelope descriptions","source_printed_pages":"581","source_pdf_pages":"605","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbenvelopecharacterization — Envelope extremal property and existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad3e401f85da77f\" href=\"?note=2ad3e401f85da77f\" title=\"27-df-pbenvelopes\">27-df-pbenvelopes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Barycentric proof of the envelope descriptions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"581"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"605"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv},\\Lambda_n\">\\(\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv},\\Lambda_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad3e401f85da77f\" href=\"?note=2ad3e401f85da77f\" title=\"27-df-pbenvelopes\">27-df-pbenvelopes</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n,U_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n,U_n\\)</span> 经该定义的直接上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\;(g(p)\\leq\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p))\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\;(\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\leq h(p))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\;(g(p)\\leq\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p))\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\;(\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\leq h(p))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)=\\max_{g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n}g(p),\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)=\\min_{h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n}h(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)=\\max_{g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n}g(p),\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)=\\min_{h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n}h(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地一般证明落实印581/PDF605 的包络描述。顶点 a 的重心表示只能给 a 质量1，所以包络在顶点等于 f。若 λ、μ分别是 p、q 的最小化分布，则 tλ+(1−t)μ 可行于 tp+(1−t)q，故 LowEnv 满足凸性；对最大化分布得到 UpEnv 凹性。有限 Jensen 不等式给任意凸扩张 g(p)≤Σλf、任意凹扩张 h(p)≥Σλf，再取最小/最大即得极端性质。包络本身属于相应函数类，故函数类上的 max/min 也确实取到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbenvelopes","status":"resolved","id":"2ad3e401f85da77f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbenvelopes]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbenvelopes","status":"resolved","id":"2ad3e401f85da77f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv},\\Lambda_n$（see [[27-df-pbenvelopes]]），$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n,U_n$ 经该定义的直接上游。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv},\\Lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n,U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\;(g(p)\\leq\\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p))\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\;(\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)\\leq h(p))\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{LowEnv}(f)(p)=\\max_{g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Convex}_n}g(p),\\qquad\\mathrm{UpEnv}(f)(p)=\\min_{h\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{Concave}_n}h(p).","display":true}],"bytes":2149,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-486","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbenvelopecharacterization|thm-pbenvelopecharacterization — Envelope extremal property and existence]]"}],"outgoing":["2ad3e401f85da77f"]}